// centered on the origin. The procedural chunk mesh stays as a fallback for
// any pair not listed here. A missing / malformed file silently falls back to
// the built-in defaults.
//
// Entry fields:
//   model:         glTF scene path for `AssetServer` (""models/rustbox/blocks/Grass/Grass_Full.glb#Scene0"").
//   preview:       palette preview PNG path under assets/.
//   scale/y_offset: placement of the spawned model root. Models are cell-aligned,
//                  so these are 1.0 / 0.0.
//   tint:          Model (keep albedo) | Kind (flat kind color) | Theme | Link.
//   collider:      BuiltinShape (engine shape math) | Box(hx,hy,hz)
//                  | Wedge(hx,hy,hz) | Mesh(path).
//   visual_bounds: axis-aligned [x, y, z] footprint of the shape.
